# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  counter_4bit.ys — Kich ban tong hop bang Yosys
#
#  Chay:  yosys -s synth/counter_4bit.ys | tee synth/reports/counter_4bit_yosys.log
#
#  Tung lenh lam gi:
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1. Doc ma nguon Verilog
read_verilog rtl/counter_4bit.v

# 2. Kiem cay phan cap va chi ro module dinh
hierarchy -check -top counter_4bit

# 3. Chuyen cac khoi always thanh cau truc netlist ben trong
proc

# 4. Toi uu co ban
opt

# 5. Nhan dien va toi uu may trang thai (neu co)
fsm
opt

# 6. Xu ly bo nho (neu co)
memory
opt

# 7. Anh xa sang cong logic doc lap cong nghe
techmap
opt

# 8. Don day va o khong dung toi
clean

# 9. In thong ke — DAY LA PHAN CAN DOC
stat

# 10. Ghi netlist da tong hop ra file
write_verilog synth/netlist/counter_4bit_synth.v
